                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-lg mt-2">A sunset proposal in Oia</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2 line-clamp-2">Our most romantic trip yet. Everything from the hotel to the private boat tour was perfect.</p>
                    <div class="mt-4 text-xs text-gray-500">By Emma &amp; James</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border">
                <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/1005/400/220" class="w-full h-48 object-cover" alt="">
                <div class="p-6">
                    <div class="text-xs text-teal-700 font-medium">Bali, Indonesia • January 2025</div>
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-lg mt-2">Finding peace in Ubud</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2 line-clamp-2">The wellness retreat changed how I see travel. Yoga at sunrise and jungle treks were magical.</p>
                    <div class="mt-4 text-xs text-gray-500">By Priya Sharma</div>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl overflow-hidden border">
                <img src="https://picsum.photos/id/1018/400/220" class="w-full h-48 object-cover" alt="">
                <div class="p-6">
                    <div class="text-xs text-teal-700 font-medium">Marrakech, Morocco • February 2025</div>
                    <h4 class="font-semibold text-lg mt-2">Colors of the Medina</h4>
                    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-2 line-clamp-2">The souks, the food, the people – this trip exceeded every expectation.</p>
                    <div class="mt-4 text-xs text-gray-500">By David Okonkwo</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Contact Section with Netlify Form -->
    <section id="contact" class="bg-white py-16 border-t">
        <div class="max-w-screen-xl mx-auto px-6">
            <div class="max-w-2xl mx-auto text-center mb-10">
                <span class="uppercase text-teal-700 text-xs tracking-[2px] font-semibold">Get in touch</span>
                <h2 class="section-header tracking-tight mt-2">Have questions? Let's talk.</h2>
                <p class="text-gray-600 mt-3">Our travel experts are here to help you plan the perfect trip.</p>
            </div>
            
            <!-- Netlify Form -->
            <form name="contact" method="POST" data-netlify="true" class="max-w-xl mx-auto" netlify>
                <input type="hidden" name="form-name" value="contact">
                
                <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5">
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1.5">Full Name</label>
                        <input type="text" name="name" required class="w-full border border-gray-300 focus:border-teal-600 rounded-2xl px-4 py-3 text-sm" placeholder="Jane Cooper">
                    </div>
                    <div>
                        <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1.5">Email Address</label>
                        <input type="email" name="email" required class="w-full border border-gray-300 focus:border-teal-600 rounded-2xl px-4 py-3 text-sm" placeholder="jane@email.com">
                    </div>
                </div>
                
                <div class="mt-5">
                    <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1.5">What are you looking for?</label>
                    <select name="interest" class="w-full border border-gray-300 focus:border-teal-600 rounded-2xl px-4 py-3 text-sm bg-white">
                        <option>General inquiry</option>
                        <option>Booking assistance</option>
                        <option>Custom trip request</option>
                        <option>Group travel</option>
                        <option>Travel insurance</option>
                    </select>
                </div>
                
                <div class="mt-5">
                    <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1.5">Message</label>
                    <textarea name="message" rows="5" required class="w-full border border-gray-300 focus:border-teal-600 rounded-3xl px-4 py-3 text-sm resize-y" placeholder="Tell us about your dream trip..."></textarea>
                </div>
                
                <div class="mt-6">
                    <button type="submit" 
                            class="w-full bg-teal-700 hover:bg-teal-800 transition-colors text-white font-semibold py-3.5 rounded-2xl text-sm">
                        Send Message
                    </button>
                </div>
                
                <p class="text-center text-xs text-gray-500 mt-4">
                    We'll reply within 24 hours
                </p>
            </form>
        </div>
    </section>

